# Native star-Sylow vertices and action tables

The 192 square-one vertices are marked by the existing 16 by 8 by 8 native
Schreier enumeration. The permutations and eleven image rows retain the
pair-label convention of `StarData`. Neighbor and fixed-mask bitsets are
untrusted data here; the following checks compare them with the native
permutations and exact row action. All tables come from the certified ATLAS
max1 words, through the witness generator in this directory's `source/`.
-/
